In the past month of February,TikTok began testing a new functionality that was designed to connect users with external content in a simpler way from the screen on which they were viewing video content. He called this characteristicJump.
Built by external providers, Jump are mini-programs and services that creators can link within their videos. Users around the world can click on those links to explore recipes, take quizzes, discover helpful learning tools and much more, creating more dynamic and hands-on experiences for our community.,Reads the official statement from TikTok about its new feature.
However, for the moment you will have a limitation, and that is that you will not be able to link to any URL you want, but it will have to be through one of the providers or services that will be integrated with this functionality.
