So what maintenance work do electric roller blinds need to do during use?
At this time, we need to replace the bearing of the electric rolling blind, and then disassemble the motor of the electric rolling blind. We also have to follow the specific steps step by step, and we can’t go according to our own preferences at will.
To keep the track running smoothly, clean up the track of the electric rolling blind cover in time, keep the interior clean, the motor and transmission chain of the electric rolling blind should be frequently filled with lubricant, check the components in the control box and the switch control box, and tighten the wiring ports. Fix screws, etc., clean the dust and dirt in the control box, the surface and the buttons to prevent the buttons from being stuck and not rebounding.
It is best for the operator to regularly check the manual switch and manual lifting decoration of the electric rolling blind to prevent the electric rolling blind cover from malfunctioning or causing unnecessary safety accidents in an emergency.
