How to install vertical blinds at home?
The method of measuring the size of the inner frame is the same as that of measuring the outer frame. First, make sure that the window depth is sufficient for the shutter blades to move freely.
8cm depth is required for fixed or horizontal installation; in addition to the width of the product blade, the number of layers of the product should be considered during push-pull installation. Generally, the two-layer push-pull must ensure that the blade movement requires 15cm depth, and the single leaf requires 10cm depth; folding installation requires Reserve a depth of 10cm.
