XYTOWER | Why Choose Steel Structure For Electric Power Tower?
People familiar with the power industry know that steel structure plays an important role in industrial production. Nowadays, steel structure is mainly architectural structure, which can be divided into five types: light steel structure, high-rise steel structure, residential steel structure, spatial steel structure and bridge steel structure.
Some experts say that the reason why steel structure is selected as the raw material of power tower is as follows:
The steel structure has thermal insulation effect. In the construction process of power tower, the use of steel structure can fill glass fiber on the outer surface, which plays a positive role in fire prevention and heat transfer.
Taking villas as an example, the roofs of low-rise villas are mostly slope, so their surface structure mostly adopts the roof truss system made of cold-formed steel structural parts. This system has excellent shockproof performance and can resist about magnitude 8 earthquake.
Strong durability. For houses with light steel structure, the steel bones in the steel structure are made of anti-corrosion high-strength galvanized sheet, which increases the service life of the steel structure.
