Accompanied by the new Auto-Empty Dock Pure empties the tank automatically after each cleaning cycle, allowing up to 7 weeks of effortless emptying. Furthermore, for the first time in a Roborock model, the 350ml water tank and 470ml dust cup have been combined for ease of use.
