The height of the water drop step can be determined according to the terrain, geology and other conditions. The height of each level of the multi-step step can be different, and the ratio of the height to the length should be the original ground The slope is compatible, and the height of the steps should generally not be greater than 0.5~0.6m, usually 0.3~0.4m.
