News - Several factors that cause color difference of artificial turf
Chromatic aberration is a relatively common quality problem of artificial turf, and chromatic aberration can also be expressed in many ways. The main reason for the color difference is that the raw material of the grass silk or the production line equipment process, or the technology in the production process does not meet the standard.
The color difference is not completely caused by the feeding. When the new material is replaced, the remaining material in the screw cannot be cleaned up, and the two-phase mixing makes the ingredient composition of this part deviate from the set configuration, and the color of the grass silk drawn from the mixed part and the new material will be different.
High-quality raw materials, advanced technology and reliable production equipment, standardized production processes and complete quality inspection systems, as well as the most important core grass silk production technology, can finally create an excellent quality of artificial turf. The color difference is a very important part of testing the quality of artificial turf and needs to be treated strictly.
