Gearboxis widely used, such as in wind turbine.Gearbox is an important mechanical component widely used in wind turbine. Its main function is to transmit the power generated by the wind wheel under the action of wind power to the generator and make it get the corresponding rotating speed.
The gearbox bears the force from the wind wheel and the reaction force generated during gear transmission, and must have enough rigidity to bear the force and moment to prevent deformation and ensure the transmission quality. The design of the gearbox body shall be carried out according to the layout arrangement, processing and assembly conditions, convenience for inspection and maintenance of the power transmission of the wind turbine generator set
